{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_IDEA_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IslaNode: Rescue Signal</strong> takes players on a survival adventure like no other, set on a deserted island with nothing but natural resources and your wits. Stranded alone, you\u2019ll need to explore, gather materials, and use a unique node-based crafting system to transform basic elements into survival tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_CRAFTING_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/crafting_1.gif?t=1741634656\" />Combine world resources to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_BUILDING_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/building_1.gif?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building allows you to create more complex shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_OBJECTIVE_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/building_2.gif?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate goal? Construct a towering lighthouse to signal for help and secure your escape. Each resource you gather, from wood to stone, plays a crucial role in building a sturdy, weather-resistant tower as you face the challenges of the island environment. With vibrant, cartoony visuals and an intuitive crafting interface, <i><strong>IslaNode</strong></i> combines the thrill of survival with the satisfaction of creative construction.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3233250?t=1741634656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3233250?t=1741634656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/f8787d65bc9ecffbafc289c22e0635a27c28cd65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741634656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/f8787d65bc9ecffbafc289c22e0635a27c28cd65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741634656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3419330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_IDEA_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IslaNode: Rescue Signal</strong> takes players on a survival adventure like no other, set on a deserted island with nothing but natural resources and your wits. Stranded alone, you\u2019ll need to explore, gather materials, and use a unique node-based crafting system to transform basic elements into survival tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_CRAFTING_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/crafting_1.gif?t=1741634656\" />Combine world resources to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_BUILDING_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/building_1.gif?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building allows you to create more complex shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/HEADER_OBJECTIVE_ENG.png?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/building_2.gif?t=1741634656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate goal? Construct a towering lighthouse to signal for help and secure your escape. Each resource you gather, from wood to stone, plays a crucial role in building a sturdy, weather-resistant tower as you face the challenges of the island environment. With vibrant, cartoony visuals and an intuitive crafting interface, <i><strong>IslaNode</strong></i> combines the thrill of survival with the satisfaction of creative construction.</p>","developers":["Gor Yeritsyan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/header.jpg?t=1741634656","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100014,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie480.mp4?t=1740329098","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie_max.mp4?t=1740329098"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100014/5e475349153b34afdcc7f7ec7701fbf2bd091558/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740329098","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740329098","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor